2026-07-09 03:37:08,755 [INFO]     the block when a CLOSED FUT 15m bar breaks the recorded first-hour range by
2026-07-09 03:37:08,755 [INFO]     >= CHOP_REARM_BUFFER_PT (15pt) with body >= CHOP_REARM_BODY_MIN (65%), in the
2026-07-09 03:37:08,755 [INFO]     regime direction (BULL=>up-break only, BEAR=>down-break only, else either).
