2026-07-09 03:37:08,755 [INFO]     one-way for the day (stays live once released); per-trade momentum/fade/CB
2026-07-09 03:37:08,755 [INFO]     guards still apply. _morning_chop_verdict_impl() stashes FH hi/lo;
2026-07-09 03:37:08,755 [INFO]     chop_rearm_check() evaluated each cycle while blocked. Logs [CHOPGATE] RE-ARMED.
